@baseUrl = http://localhost:5111
@adminToken = replace-with-your-development-admin-token
@categoryId = replace-with-id-from-create-response

### User: list categories without a token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories?page=1&pageSize=20

### User: read category without a token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}

### List categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Search categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories?search=drinks&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameAr": "مشروبات",
  "nameEn": "Drinks"
}

### Read category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameAr": "مشروبات باردة",
  "nameEn": "Cold drinks"
}

### Delete an empty category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
